<title>UK: NIB sets 500 mln Swedish crown six-year bond.</title>
<headline>NIB sets 500 mln Swedish crown six-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Svenska.</p>
<p> BORROWER   NORDIC INVESTMENT BANK</p>
<p> AMT    500 MLN SKR   COUPON     6.0 PCT   MATURITY    01.AUG.03</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.375   PAY DATE    01.AUG.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875     LISTING    LONDON    PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AAA/AAA   DENOMS (K) 10-100    SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   MGT/UND    0.625     SELL CONC  1.25</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF AN EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
